<title>USA: LL&amp;E participates in 15 winning bids.</title>
<headline>LL&amp;E participates in 15 winning bids.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS, La. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Louisiana Land and Exploration Co said Thursday it participated in winning bids for 15 tracts at Wednesday's western Gulf of Mexico lease sale.</p>
<p>LL&amp;E said its share of the total lease bonus for the fifteen blocks is $3.0 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
